/T (This theater marks the first extensive deployment of AI-driven military targeting systems. Platforms such as "The Gospel" and "Lavender" use machine learning to process mass surveillance data, cell phone records, and social media feeds to generate vast target lists at unprecedented speeds. UN investigators note that this automation compresses the timeline for human verification, significantly raising the risk of civilian casualties and creating deep accountability gaps regarding international humanitarian law \(IHL\). )
/E (This theater marks the first extensive deployment of AI-driven military targeting systems. Platforms such as "The Gospel" and "Lavender" use machine learning to process mass surveillance data, cell phone records, and social media feeds to generate vast target lists at unprecedented speeds. UN investigators note that this automation compresses the timeline for human verification, significantly raising the risk of civilian casualties and creating deep accountability gaps regarding international humanitarian law \(IHL\). )
