/E (AI implementation in Yemen is primarily seen in the tactical systems of Houthi uncrewed aerial vehicles \(UAVs\) and loitering munitions. Supplied with tech components from external networks, these drones utilize basic machine-vision algorithms for autonomous terminal guidance, allowing them to home in on fixed infrastructure targets or naval vessels without active radio control links, rendering traditional electronic warfare jamming less effective. )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [3]
>>
