/T (The IDF uses AI-driven sensor fusion systems to counter Hezbollah's asymmetric tactics. By combining real-time satellite imagery, acoustic gunshot detection data, and thermal feeds from high-altitude drones, these systems instantaneously identify the exact launch coordinates of hidden mobile rocket launchers. This data is fed directly to automated artillery batteries, allowing for counter-battery fire within seconds of a launch. )
