/T (This interstate conflict represents a highly sophisticated AI-driven theater. Israel relies heavily on AI-integrated multi-layered defense networks \(Iron Dome, David's Sling, Arrow 3\) that use predictive modeling to instantly calculate intercept trajectories for hundreds of incoming projectiles simultaneously. Conversely, offensive operations on both sides employ AI-driven cyber weapons capable of mapping software vulnerabilities in critical national infrastructure and deploying self-propagating malware without human intervention.  Lebanon )
