/Title (The conflict is defined by complex multi-front dynamics. In Turkey, tentative discussions regarding a domestic peace process occur alongside ongoing military operations. In northern Syria, Kurdish autonomous structures face pressure from the new transitional Syrian government in Damascus and Turkish forces. In western Iran, Iranian security forces carry out targeted campaigns against Kurdish opposition groups amid widespread domestic unrest.)
