/Title (Red Sea  The conflict developed directly from the regional escalation of the Gaza war. In late 2023, the Houthi movement in Yemen declared its intention to target any commercial or military vessels in the Red Sea linked to Israel, or those bound for Israeli ports, as an act of solidarity with the Palestinian population. The Red Sea is an essential global maritime artery, carrying roughly 12% of international trade and 30% of global container traffic via the Bab al-Mandab Strait. The persistent attacks forced a major international maritime security crisis.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1708 0 R
/Next 1704 0 R
