/Title (The conflict is a century-long dispute over land, sovereignty, and national identity in the Levant. It traces its modern roots to the late 19th-century rise of Zionism and the subsequent British Mandate for Palestine. The 1947 UN Partition Plan \(Resolution 181\) proposed separate Jewish and Arab states, which led to the 1948 Arab-Israeli War, the establishment of Israel, and the displacement of over 700,000 Palestinians \(the Nakba\). Despite the 1993 Oslo Accords establishing the Palestinian Authority \(PA\) for limited self-governance, continuous settlement expansion, the blockade of Gaza since 2007, and the absence of a viable path to a two-state solution have entrenched a cycle of systemic violence, only escalating after the 7th October Hamas attacks.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1751 0 R
/Next 1767 0 R
>>
endobj
1760 0 obj
<<
/Title (This theater marks the first extensive deployment of AI-driven military targeting systems. Platforms such as "The Gospel" and "Lavender" use machine learning to process mass surveillance data, cell phone records, and social media feeds to generate vast target lists at unprecedented speeds. UN investigators note that this automation compresses the timeline for human verification, significantly raising the risk of civilian casualties and creating deep accountability gaps regarding international humanitarian law \(IHL\).)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1751 0 R
/Prev 1767 0 R
>>
endobj
